Dialogue: 0,0:00:19.33,0:00:21.62,Default,,0,0,0,,There you are.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:23.33,0:00:26.41,Default,,0,0,0,,P.E.'s already started.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:28.08,0:00:31.45,Default,,0,0,0,,They threw my gym clothes in the garbage.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:31.45,0:00:33.62,Default,,0,0,0,,Did they?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:33.62,0:00:36.29,Default,,0,0,0,,You're right, I remember that now.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:37.37,0:00:42.25,Default,,0,0,0,,Everyone's having so much fun. I hate them.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:42.25,0:00:45.20,Default,,0,0,0,,I did, didn't I?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:45.20,0:00:48.12,Default,,0,0,0,,I hate people in cliques, too.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:48.12,0:00:51.91,Default,,0,0,0,,Because it made me feel like I was\Ngetting excluded for no good reason.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:51.91,0:00:54.25,Default,,0,0,0,,I hate breaks, too.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:54.25,0:00:59.41,Default,,0,0,0,,Because it felt like everyone was\Npointing out how isolated I was.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:59.41,0:01:03.29,Default,,0,0,0,,I hated teachers, too, because\Nthey made us work in groups,
Dialogue: 0,0:01:03.29,0:01:05.41,Default,,0,0,0,,and I'd get excluded.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:05.41,0:01:07.87,Default,,0,0,0,,I especially hated special events at school.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:07.87,0:01:13.87,Default,,0,0,0,,Thinking back on those days, I can't\Nremember a single thing I didn't hate.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:13.87,0:01:19.12,Default,,0,0,0,,Nobody needs me around, anyway.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:20.29,0:01:22.54,Default,,0,0,0,,Can I just die?
Dialogue: 0,0:01:26.25,0:01:29.25,Default,,0,0,0,,You should probably hold off on dying.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:29.25,0:01:34.58,Default,,0,0,0,,Wait a little longer and you'll make\Na friend. An annoying one, but still.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:34.58,0:01:39.83,Default,,0,0,0,,You'll also meet a tall guy who's\Nkind and a girl who's friendly,
Dialogue: 0,0:01:39.83,0:01:43.83,Default,,0,0,0,,and a kinda-cowardly student council\Npresident and his little posse.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:43.83,0:01:48.41,Default,,0,0,0,,Lots of people will want to be friends with you.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:48.41,0:01:50.12,Default,,0,0,0,,Not only that,
Dialogue: 0,0:01:50.12,0:01:52.66,Default,,0,0,0,,but you'll meet someone\Nwho cries for you, laughs for you,
Dialogue: 0,0:01:52.66,0:01:57.45,Default,,0,0,0,,gets sad for you, gets mad for you,\Nand scolds you when you need scolding.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:01.50,0:02:04.54,Default,,0,0,0,,She's waiting for you, I promise.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:04.54,0:02:08.04,Default,,0,0,0,,If that's true, then...
Dialogue: 0,0:02:11.12,0:02:13.33,Default,,0,0,0,,Then...
Dialogue: 0,0:02:16.20,0:02:20.29,Default,,0,0,0,,Huh? What was I just dreaming about?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:21.95,0:02:24.87,Default,,0,0,0,,I wanna see Hori-san.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:36.54,0:02:46.58,Default,,0,0,0,,{\an8}"Horimiya"
Dialogue: 0,0:03:57.12,0:04:00.41,Default,,0,0,0,,The boy I love is really weak.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:02.50,0:04:05.00,Default,,0,0,0,,Really, really weak.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:06.45,0:04:11.91,Default,,0,0,0,,He doesn't actually like yelling at people.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:13.66,0:04:17.29,Default,,0,0,0,,He'll laugh about being unathletic,
Dialogue: 0,0:04:17.29,0:04:20.12,Default,,0,0,0,,when really, he wishes he wasn't.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:20.12,0:04:23.91,Default,,0,0,0,,Boys and girls alike all fawn over him,
Dialogue: 0,0:04:23.91,0:04:26.41,Default,,0,0,0,,which makes him happy,
Dialogue: 0,0:04:26.41,0:04:30.83,Default,,0,0,0,,but every now and then,\Nit makes him feel anxious.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:32.66,0:04:32.83,Default,,0,0,0,,{\an8}"The Truth Deception Reveals"
Dialogue: 0,0:04:32.83,0:04:35.79,Default,,0,0,0,,{\an8}"The Truth Deception Reveals"
Dialogue: 0,0:04:32.83,0:04:35.79,Default,,0,0,0,,There's so much he struggles with,\Nand I love him so much.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:35.79,0:04:37.91,Default,,0,0,0,,There's so much he struggles with,\Nand I love him so much.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:45.95,0:04:52.37,Default,,0,0,0,,O-Oh, no! Sengoku-kun, get it, I'm scared!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:52.37,0:04:56.62,Default,,0,0,0,,His expression screams "I'm scared, too!"
Dialogue: 0,0:04:56.62,0:04:58.25,Default,,0,0,0,,But...
Dialogue: 0,0:05:00.04,0:05:05.12,Default,,0,0,0,,That really freaked him out. Good job.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:10.25,0:05:16.79,Default,,0,0,0,,The boy I love is weak,\Nbut he tries really hard.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:16.79,0:05:18.95,Default,,0,0,0,,But you know,
Dialogue: 0,0:05:18.95,0:05:23.37,Default,,0,0,0,,back when we met,\Nhe was a totally different person.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:24.45,0:05:29.37,Default,,0,0,0,,Man, I have such a crush on Ayasaki.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:29.37,0:05:31.79,Default,,0,0,0,,Her face is so tiny and cute, you know?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:31.79,0:05:33.41,Default,,0,0,0,,Yeah, totally!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:33.41,0:05:37.91,Default,,0,0,0,,She's so hard to approach, though.\NLike, she thinks she's too good for us.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:37.91,0:05:41.37,Default,,0,0,0,,Probably 'cause she knows all\Nthe guys have the hots for her.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:41.37,0:05:45.79,Default,,0,0,0,,Out of all the girls,\NAyasaki and Kono really stick out.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:45.79,0:05:47.58,Default,,0,0,0,,They're like Beauty and the Beast.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:47.58,0:05:50.50,Default,,0,0,0,,You think so? They're both pretty normal.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:50.50,0:05:53.62,Default,,0,0,0,,C'mon, dude, Ayasaki's super hot.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:53.62,0:05:56.58,Default,,0,0,0,,Not really. They both look normal.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:09.83,0:06:13.91,Default,,0,0,0,,What were you reading in class just now?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:13.91,0:06:15.79,Default,,0,0,0,,Some manga?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:15.79,0:06:16.66,Default,,0,0,0,,Goethe.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:16.66,0:06:18.95,Default,,0,0,0,,Gerta? What's that?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:18.95,0:06:20.87,Default,,0,0,0,,Goethe. He's an author.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:20.87,0:06:24.58,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh, that's not the name of the book. Is it good?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:24.58,0:06:27.00,Default,,0,0,0,,Do you like to read, too, Ayasaki-san?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:27.00,0:06:31.37,Default,,0,0,0,,Not during class, but yeah, I like reading.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:31.37,0:06:33.04,Default,,0,0,0,,Like {\i1}Grimm's Fairy Tales{\i0}.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:33.04,0:06:34.50,Default,,0,0,0,,You mean like, {\i1}Snow White{\i0}?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:34.50,0:06:37.00,Default,,0,0,0,,Yeah, like {\i1}Snow White{\i0}.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:42.12,0:06:42.37,Default,,0,0,0,,{\an8}"Snow White"
Dialogue: 0,0:06:42.37,0:06:44.00,Default,,0,0,0,,{\an8}"Snow White"
Dialogue: 0,0:06:42.37,0:06:44.00,Default,,0,0,0,,I brought these for you to borrow.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:44.00,0:06:44.16,Default,,0,0,0,,I brought these for you to borrow.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:44.16,0:06:45.79,Default,,0,0,0,,Really?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:45.79,0:06:50.75,Default,,0,0,0,,There are a bunch of stories in there,\Nso hopefully you'll find one you like.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:50.75,0:06:52.70,Default,,0,0,0,,Wow, thanks!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:52.70,0:06:54.58,Default,,0,0,0,,That'll be a fun read, Remi.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:54.58,0:06:56.16,Default,,0,0,0,,Yeah!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:00.25,0:07:02.75,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh, do you like books like these, too, Kono-san?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:02.75,0:07:05.45,Default,,0,0,0,,Wait, me? Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:05.45,0:07:08.83,Default,,0,0,0,,Then you can borrow them after Ayasaki-san.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:08.83,0:07:12.70,Default,,0,0,0,,I really like the third story in\Nthe collection. It's really captivating.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:12.70,0:07:14.54,Default,,0,0,0,,Wait, are you sure?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:14.54,0:07:16.16,Default,,0,0,0,,Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:16.16,0:07:17.62,Default,,0,0,0,,Th-Thanks.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:17.62,0:07:19.54,Default,,0,0,0,,You're welcome.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:21.95,0:07:26.54,Default,,0,0,0,,I really liked these. Thanks!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:26.54,0:07:27.79,Default,,0,0,0,,Then here, read these next.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:27.79,0:07:31.45,Default,,0,0,0,,Whoa, more books?! Sweet!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:31.45,0:07:32.95,Default,,0,0,0,,How many books do you own?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:32.95,0:07:37.91,Default,,0,0,0,,They're mostly my parents'. We have\Na whole room full of them at my house.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:37.91,0:07:40.87,Default,,0,0,0,,Really? I wish I could see.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:40.87,0:07:44.12,Default,,0,0,0,,You want to? You can.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:44.12,0:07:47.33,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh, don't worry; I won't be\Nweird about it or anything!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:47.33,0:07:50.87,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh, uh, sure, got it.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:53.37,0:07:53.95,Default,,0,0,0,,{\an8}"Sengoku"
Dialogue: 0,0:07:53.95,0:07:55.37,Default,,0,0,0,,{\an8}"Sengoku"
Dialogue: 0,0:07:53.95,0:07:55.37,Default,,0,0,0,,Wow, you really {\i1}do {\i0}have a whole roomful!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:55.37,0:07:58.41,Default,,0,0,0,,Wow, you really {\i1}do {\i0}have a whole roomful!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:58.41,0:08:02.33,Default,,0,0,0,,We haven't cleaned in here much,\Nso watch out for the dust.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:03.95,0:08:05.33,Default,,0,0,0,,Are you okay?!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:05.33,0:08:09.12,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm fine! I shouldn't have\Ntouched without asking.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:09.12,0:08:11.91,Default,,0,0,0,,I just wanted to see this one book.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:11.91,0:08:14.20,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh, that one's really old.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:14.20,0:08:15.87,Default,,0,0,0,,What's it about?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:15.87,0:08:20.00,Default,,0,0,0,,The day before the world ends, I think?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:20.00,0:08:23.16,Default,,0,0,0,,Is it the whole world,\Nor just Japan that gets destroyed?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:23.16,0:08:26.58,Default,,0,0,0,,Think it's the whole world.\NEveryone goes into a panic.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:26.58,0:08:29.08,Default,,0,0,0,,If you knew the world was going to end tomorrow,
Dialogue: 0,0:08:29.08,0:08:31.91,Default,,0,0,0,,you probably wouldn't feel like\Ndoing much of anything, huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:31.91,0:08:35.37,Default,,0,0,0,,You think so? I'd wanna\Nblow through all my money.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:35.37,0:08:37.04,Default,,0,0,0,,And I'd load up on desserts, too.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:37.04,0:08:41.00,Default,,0,0,0,,Huh? You're spending your\Nlast day on Earth eating dessert?!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:41.00,0:08:44.54,Default,,0,0,0,,There are tons I've never tried! Might as well!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:44.54,0:08:47.25,Default,,0,0,0,,I see.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:47.25,0:08:51.08,Default,,0,0,0,,Are your pigtails up higher today?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:52.50,0:08:55.25,Default,,0,0,0,,Y-Yeah, I just felt like it.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:55.25,0:08:57.29,Default,,0,0,0,,I like it. It looks nice!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:57.29,0:08:59.29,Default,,0,0,0,,Really?!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:05.45,0:09:09.08,Default,,0,0,0,,If you're cute, you can do\Nwhatever, you'll still be cute!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:09.08,0:09:12.58,Default,,0,0,0,,Guess you don't understand where\NI'm coming from, though, Sengoku-kun.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:12.58,0:09:15.87,Default,,0,0,0,,Sorry to interrupt! Can I borrow you?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:17.00,0:09:20.12,Default,,0,0,0,,Thanks for lending these to me! I read 'em all.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:20.12,0:09:22.12,Default,,0,0,0,,You didn't have to rush through them.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:22.12,0:09:25.70,Default,,0,0,0,,I didn't! They were so good,\NI ended up on a reading binge.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:25.70,0:09:29.37,Default,,0,0,0,,Man, though, I really wouldn't\Nwant the world to end tomorrow!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:29.37,0:09:31.25,Default,,0,0,0,,What about all those desserts, though?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:31.25,0:09:34.83,Default,,0,0,0,,The end of the world is no time for desserts!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:40.20,0:09:43.70,Default,,0,0,0,,Kamioka has a crush on you, Ayasaki-san.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:43.70,0:09:45.83,Default,,0,0,0,,Mmkay.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:45.83,0:09:49.87,Default,,0,0,0,,Hey, can I go over to your\Nplace again today, Sengoku-kun?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:50.91,0:09:52.04,Default,,0,0,0,,Sure.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:52.04,0:09:57.37,Default,,0,0,0,,Just, I know you're used\Nto talking to guys, Ayasaki-san,
Dialogue: 0,0:09:57.37,0:10:01.16,Default,,0,0,0,,but I might get the wrong\Nidea about your intentions.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:04.08,0:10:09.37,Default,,0,0,0,,You'll like this series, Ayasaki-san.\NIt's long, but totally worth the read.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:10.50,0:10:13.25,Default,,0,0,0,,Can't wait to read it, then.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:15.58,0:10:18.87,Default,,0,0,0,,Hey, Sengoku-kun?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:18.87,0:10:23.79,Default,,0,0,0,,So, Sengoku-kun, I, uh...
Dialogue: 0,0:10:24.87,0:10:25.91,Default,,0,0,0,,What is it?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:25.91,0:10:30.25,Default,,0,0,0,,Nothing, just, uh, what if--
Dialogue: 0,0:10:30.25,0:10:35.25,Default,,0,0,0,,What if the world was gonna end\Ntomorrow? What would you do?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:35.25,0:10:39.04,Default,,0,0,0,,Huh? Oh, you mean like that book?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:39.04,0:10:42.91,Default,,0,0,0,,I mean, kind of, but... sure.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:42.91,0:10:45.45,Default,,0,0,0,,I'd tell you I liked you.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:47.83,0:10:50.91,Default,,0,0,0,,Then I'd turn to space dust.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:50.91,0:10:52.83,Default,,0,0,0,,The end.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:57.54,0:10:59.79,Default,,0,0,0,,Was that a joke?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:59.79,0:11:01.41,Default,,0,0,0,,No.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:02.62,0:11:05.04,Default,,0,0,0,,It wasn't.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:07.12,0:11:09.50,Default,,0,0,0,,Never mind, just forget it!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:13.12,0:11:14.66,Default,,0,0,0,,Why're you so embarrassed?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:14.66,0:11:17.58,Default,,0,0,0,,I-I am {\i1}not {\i0}embarrassed!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:17.58,0:11:19.41,Default,,0,0,0,,C'mon, don't lie.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:19.41,0:11:22.58,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm not lying! I'm not embarrassed at all!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:22.58,0:11:26.33,Default,,0,0,0,,I know you are. Your face is all red!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:26.33,0:11:28.12,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm glad.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:28.12,0:11:29.62,Default,,0,0,0,,Yeah, sure.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:29.62,0:11:31.45,Default,,0,0,0,,You know,
Dialogue: 0,0:11:31.45,0:11:35.37,Default,,0,0,0,,I like you, too, Sengoku-kun!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:39.62,0:11:44.08,Default,,0,0,0,,I like you, too, Remi.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:46.25,0:11:46.70,Default,,0,0,0,,{\an8}"Through the Seasons With You"
Dialogue: 0,0:11:46.70,0:11:48.50,Default,,0,0,0,,{\an8}"Through the Seasons With You"
Dialogue: 0,0:11:46.70,0:11:48.50,Default,,0,0,0,,Here. Thanks for letting me borrow it.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:48.50,0:11:48.70,Default,,0,0,0,,Here. Thanks for letting me borrow it.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:48.70,0:11:51.45,Default,,0,0,0,,Huh? You finished it in just one day?!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:51.45,0:11:54.83,Default,,0,0,0,,I finished studying early,\Nso I had some extra time.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:54.83,0:12:00.33,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh, cool. What'd you think\Nof this bestselling tearjerker?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:00.33,0:12:02.83,Default,,0,0,0,,It was okay.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:02.83,0:12:05.08,Default,,0,0,0,,He's lying.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:05.08,0:12:08.00,Default,,0,0,0,,He cried while reading it last night.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:08.00,0:12:12.75,Default,,0,0,0,,When we met, he didn't get swept away\Nby those around him. I loved him then.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:12.75,0:12:14.00,Default,,0,0,0,,And I love who he is now, too.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:14.00,0:12:20.29,Default,,0,0,0,,His weak points, the fact that\Nhe can't lie, how hard he tries--
Dialogue: 0,0:12:20.29,0:12:22.95,Default,,0,0,0,,I love all of him.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:24.75,0:12:27.54,Default,,0,0,0,,So... why the sudden urge to give me a manicure?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:27.54,0:12:31.12,Default,,0,0,0,,Well, I was cleaning my room\Nand found some unopened bottles.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:31.12,0:12:35.00,Default,,0,0,0,,I thought this color'd look good on you.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:35.00,0:12:36.79,Default,,0,0,0,,Okay.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:39.04,0:12:41.37,Default,,0,0,0,,O-Oh, no.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:41.37,0:12:43.50,Default,,0,0,0,,I shouldn't, but I want to.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:43.50,0:12:45.08,Default,,0,0,0,,She'd be so mad.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:45.08,0:12:47.54,Default,,0,0,0,,Miyamura, other foot!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:47.54,0:12:49.45,Default,,0,0,0,,But...
Dialogue: 0,0:12:49.45,0:12:50.79,Default,,0,0,0,,Miyamura?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:50.79,0:12:52.37,Default,,0,0,0,,Gimme your other foot, c'mon--
Dialogue: 0,0:12:52.37,0:12:53.62,Default,,0,0,0,,{\an8}"PLOP"
Dialogue: 0,0:13:02.83,0:13:05.41,Default,,0,0,0,,I thought if I stepped on you...
Dialogue: 0,0:13:05.41,0:13:09.66,Default,,0,0,0,,I'd get enough EXP to level up.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:09.66,0:13:11.33,Default,,0,0,0,,What?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:11.33,0:13:12.37,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm kidding! I'm so sorry!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:12.37,0:13:15.66,Default,,0,0,0,,You're always messing with me,\Nso I figured I'd try messing with you today!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:15.66,0:13:16.95,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm sorry! I'm really sorry!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:16.95,0:13:20.87,Default,,0,0,0,,It's okay, I'm not, like, mad.\NI'm just kind of surprised.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:20.87,0:13:26.08,Default,,0,0,0,,Plus, like, you're always going off\Non Shindo-kun and Sawada-san,
Dialogue: 0,0:13:26.08,0:13:28.20,Default,,0,0,0,,but when you're with me,\Nyou're so calm and well-mannered,
Dialogue: 0,0:13:28.20,0:13:31.95,Default,,0,0,0,,so are you, like, faking it for me?\NIs this not you?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:31.95,0:13:35.50,Default,,0,0,0,,No, this is the real me, I promise.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:35.50,0:13:36.79,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:36.79,0:13:41.58,Default,,0,0,0,,I mean, would you rather\NI yelled at you and hit you instead?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:41.58,0:13:43.79,Default,,0,0,0,,No, definitely--
Dialogue: 0,0:13:44.79,0:13:47.25,Default,,0,0,0,,Goddamn. C'mon, Kyoko!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:47.25,0:13:50.16,Default,,0,0,0,,Who the hell d'ya think\Nyou're talking to, bitch?!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:50.16,0:13:51.79,Default,,0,0,0,,Actually, that's kind of hot.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:51.79,0:13:53.16,Default,,0,0,0,,What?!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:55.66,0:13:57.04,Default,,0,0,0,,Mornin', Miyamura.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:57.04,0:14:00.70,Default,,0,0,0,,Hey. How's it hangin', Ishikawa?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:03.58,0:14:04.70,Default,,0,0,0,,Fine.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:04.70,0:14:06.29,Default,,0,0,0,,Damn, dude,
Dialogue: 0,0:14:06.29,0:14:10.16,Default,,0,0,0,,you still listening to this, Iura?\NI mean, it's all bangers, but damn.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:10.16,0:14:10.70,Default,,0,0,0,,--Dude.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:10.70,0:14:11.45,Default,,0,0,0,,--I have no idea, man!\N--Dude.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:11.45,0:14:12.45,Default,,0,0,0,,--I have no idea, man!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:12.45,0:14:16.41,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh, Miyamura-kun. Could I please\Nborrow your Math B textbook?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:16.41,0:14:21.33,Default,,0,0,0,,Man, seriously, Prez? You forgot yours?\NGet your shit together, man!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:21.33,0:14:22.75,Default,,0,0,0,,Ishikawa-kun!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:22.75,0:14:25.12,Default,,0,0,0,,Don't look at me! I got no clue what's going on!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:25.12,0:14:26.79,Default,,0,0,0,,What's up with you today, Miyamura?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:26.79,0:14:27.00,Default,,0,0,0,,{\an8}"Gloom"
Dialogue: 0,0:14:26.79,0:14:27.00,Default,,0,0,0,,What's up with you today, Miyamura?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:27.00,0:14:27.87,Default,,0,0,0,,{\an8}"Gloom"
Dialogue: 0,0:14:27.00,0:14:27.87,Default,,0,0,0,,Kill me.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:27.87,0:14:29.08,Default,,0,0,0,,{\an8}"Gloom"
Dialogue: 0,0:14:27.87,0:14:29.08,Default,,0,0,0,,Huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:29.08,0:14:29.45,Default,,0,0,0,,Huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:29.45,0:14:32.54,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm guessing this is something Her Highness\Nthe Ice Queen wanted you to do.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:32.54,0:14:33.37,Default,,0,0,0,,Yep.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:33.37,0:14:36.08,Default,,0,0,0,,If you don't want to do this,\Nthen you should tell her.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:36.08,0:14:37.33,Default,,0,0,0,,Morning!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:37.33,0:14:40.00,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm begging you, Ishikawa-kun, get it together!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:40.00,0:14:41.95,Default,,0,0,0,,Stop making this my problem!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:41.95,0:14:44.66,Default,,0,0,0,,Wow, it was that tough?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:44.66,0:14:47.75,Default,,0,0,0,,Guess I'll never get to see you\Nget all violent with me, then.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:47.75,0:14:51.83,Default,,0,0,0,,Well, I'll just wait for you\Nto forget, then give it a try.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:51.83,0:14:54.62,Default,,0,0,0,,Really?! Oh, man, I can't wait!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:54.62,0:14:55.70,Default,,0,0,0,,Later.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:55.70,0:14:56.91,Default,,0,0,0,,See ya!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:56.91,0:14:58.62,Default,,0,0,0,,Yup!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:03.12,0:15:06.75,Default,,0,0,0,,Wait, I don't think the physics\Nroom is open during lunch.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:06.75,0:15:09.50,Default,,0,0,0,,What? Oh, I think you're right!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:09.50,0:15:14.54,Default,,0,0,0,,Ugh, I'll drop these off after lunch.\NJust tell our teacher I'll be late.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:14.54,0:15:15.58,Default,,0,0,0,,Want me to go instead?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:15.58,0:15:17.37,Default,,0,0,0,,Nah, I got it.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:17.91,0:15:20.00,Default,,0,0,0,,{\an8}"Sigh"
Dialogue: 0,0:15:21.87,0:15:24.00,Default,,0,0,0,,Excuse me. Do you have a moment?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:24.00,0:15:28.04,Default,,0,0,0,,Huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:28.04,0:15:32.95,Default,,0,0,0,,Wait, hold on. Is this it?\NIs now the time to try that?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:32.95,0:15:38.75,Default,,0,0,0,,But how should I act? What would make her happy?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:38.75,0:15:41.58,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh, hey, remember that--
Dialogue: 0,0:15:42.75,0:15:46.87,Default,,0,0,0,,Who the hell do you think you're\Ntalking to, you frickin' airhead?!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:46.87,0:15:50.95,Default,,0,0,0,,Stop actin' like we're all buddy-buddy,\N'cause we're not! Now shut the hell up!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:57.54,0:16:00.37,Default,,0,0,0,,Hori-san, I really can't do this!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:00.37,0:16:02.79,Default,,0,0,0,,That's the last time I'm gonna yell at you.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:04.16,0:16:07.58,Default,,0,0,0,,Hori-san... I'm so lost.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:18.66,0:16:25.45,Default,,0,0,0,,And now they're all talking about\Nhow we were fighting in the AV room.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:25.45,0:16:28.50,Default,,0,0,0,,I feel bad for freaking out the underclassmen.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:28.50,0:16:31.12,Default,,0,0,0,,What's up, Yuki?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:31.12,0:16:32.37,Default,,0,0,0,,Huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:32.37,0:16:35.37,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh, just...
Dialogue: 0,0:16:35.37,0:16:36.95,Default,,0,0,0,,Just what?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:37.70,0:16:39.41,Default,,0,0,0,,You got asked out?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:39.41,0:16:42.16,Default,,0,0,0,,Yeah, four days ago.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:42.16,0:16:43.04,Default,,0,0,0,,That long ago?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:43.04,0:16:44.25,Default,,0,0,0,,Don't leave him hanging.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:44.25,0:16:47.41,Default,,0,0,0,,W-Well, I have to go turn him down!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:47.41,0:16:49.20,Default,,0,0,0,,Huh? You're turning him down?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:49.20,0:16:52.45,Default,,0,0,0,,Of course I am! I don't even know him.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:52.45,0:16:56.29,Default,,0,0,0,,He looked, like, really serious, too.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:56.29,0:17:00.62,Default,,0,0,0,,I just feel bad going up to him\Nwith only a "Sorry, no dice!"
Dialogue: 0,0:17:03.79,0:17:06.20,Default,,0,0,0,,Why don't you have someone\Npretend to be your boyfriend?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:06.20,0:17:07.20,Default,,0,0,0,,Like Toru!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:07.20,0:17:08.79,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh, he'd hate that.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:08.79,0:17:12.29,Default,,0,0,0,,I don't think he would, as long\Nas you explained what's going on.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:12.29,0:17:13.91,Default,,0,0,0,,I dunno...
Dialogue: 0,0:17:13.91,0:17:18.37,Default,,0,0,0,,Yeah, it's happening after school.\NYup. See ya then.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:18.37,0:17:19.70,Default,,0,0,0,,Ishikawa-kun's in.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:19.70,0:17:21.37,Default,,0,0,0,,That was fast!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:23.00,0:17:25.66,Default,,0,0,0,,So, what do you want me to do?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:25.66,0:17:29.33,Default,,0,0,0,,Just kind of feel her up\Nwhile she turns him down.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:29.33,0:17:31.70,Default,,0,0,0,,Calm down, Satan!\NI can't do him dirty like that!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:31.70,0:17:33.29,Default,,0,0,0,,C'mon, Hori!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:33.29,0:17:35.41,Default,,0,0,0,,So what class is he in?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:35.41,0:17:36.62,Default,,0,0,0,,Class 6, I think?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:36.62,0:17:38.79,Default,,0,0,0,,Yeah, Class 6. His name's Yanagi-kun.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:38.79,0:17:41.50,Default,,0,0,0,,Hold on, Yoshikawa. You sure\Nyou wanna use me for this?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:41.50,0:17:45.33,Default,,0,0,0,,Wouldn't you want, like, a way\Nhotter guy to pull this off?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:45.33,0:17:49.91,Default,,0,0,0,,W-Well, you're definitely a little\Nhotter than him, so it's fine!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:49.91,0:17:50.95,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh. 'Kay.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:50.95,0:17:52.50,Default,,0,0,0,,Just a little! Just a {\i1}little{\i0}, okay?!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:52.50,0:17:53.87,Default,,0,0,0,,Heard you loud and clear.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:53.87,0:17:56.54,Default,,0,0,0,,Shouldn't we head out already?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:56.54,0:17:57.45,Default,,0,0,0,,Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:57.45,0:17:59.54,Default,,0,0,0,,Wait, you're coming, too?!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:59.54,0:17:59.75,Default,,0,0,0,,{\an8}"I wanna see who it is!"
Dialogue: 0,0:17:59.54,0:17:59.75,Default,,0,0,0,,Wait, you're coming, too?!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:59.75,0:18:03.00,Default,,0,0,0,,{\an8}"I wanna see who it is!"
Dialogue: 0,0:17:59.75,0:18:03.00,Default,,0,0,0,,Heck yeah! I'm worried about you!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:03.00,0:18:05.66,Default,,0,0,0,,{\an8}"I wanna see who it is!"
Dialogue: 0,0:18:03.00,0:18:05.66,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh. Thanks, Hori.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:05.66,0:18:05.83,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh. Thanks, Hori.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:05.83,0:18:06.83,Default,,0,0,0,,Okay, let's go.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:06.83,0:18:11.75,Default,,0,0,0,,Huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:11.75,0:18:14.45,Default,,0,0,0,,We're dating, right? Just for today.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:19.50,0:18:22.50,Default,,0,0,0,,I forget who's even in Class 6.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:22.50,0:18:25.20,Default,,0,0,0,,Yeah, hard to remember\Nwhen they're not in your class.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:25.20,0:18:28.00,Default,,0,0,0,,Maybe Ayasaki-san knows?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:28.00,0:18:30.20,Default,,0,0,0,,Just for today.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:33.12,0:18:35.66,Default,,0,0,0,,You don't have to say anything, Toru.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:35.66,0:18:36.66,Default,,0,0,0,,You sure?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:36.66,0:18:39.91,Default,,0,0,0,,Yeah. Sorry for making\Nyou go along with all this.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:39.91,0:18:42.12,Default,,0,0,0,,You better be sorry.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:42.12,0:18:45.08,Default,,0,0,0,,Let me say just one thing to him, then.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:45.08,0:18:49.79,Default,,0,0,0,,Like, "She's {\i1}my {\i0}girlfriend." That okay?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:49.79,0:18:50.83,Default,,0,0,0,,What?!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:50.83,0:18:53.58,Default,,0,0,0,,Y-You just have to {\i1}pretend{\i0}\Nto be my boyfriend, you know!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:53.58,0:18:55.08,Default,,0,0,0,,Yeah. That's pretending.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:55.08,0:18:59.95,Default,,0,0,0,,Sure, whatever, say it!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:59.95,0:19:01.25,Default,,0,0,0,,I can't hear what they're saying.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:01.25,0:19:04.16,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh, there he is!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:04.16,0:19:12.75,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm so sorry I'm late, Yoshikawa-san!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:12.75,0:19:14.95,Default,,0,0,0,,Our teacher needed me for something.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:14.95,0:19:17.58,Default,,0,0,0,,{\an8}"S H O C K"
Dialogue: 0,0:19:14.95,0:19:17.58,Default,,0,0,0,,Holy crap, he's gorgeous!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:17.58,0:19:20.00,Default,,0,0,0,,He's a {\i1}zillion {\i0}times hotter than Toru!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:20.00,0:19:20.95,Default,,0,0,0,,C'mon.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:20.95,0:19:23.16,Default,,0,0,0,,Um, uh, I'm...
Dialogue: 0,0:19:23.16,0:19:27.33,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh, hello. I'm Akane Yanagi from Class 6.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:27.33,0:19:29.20,Default,,0,0,0,,God, even his {\i1}name {\i0}is cool!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:29.20,0:19:31.33,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm Ishikawa.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:31.33,0:19:34.95,Default,,0,0,0,,Miyamura's the pretty guy in our group,\Nand even {\i1}he {\i0}pales in comparison!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:34.95,0:19:37.29,Default,,0,0,0,,Hang in there, Ishikawa-kun!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:39.33,0:19:41.87,Default,,0,0,0,,So you have a boyfriend.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:41.87,0:19:44.62,Default,,0,0,0,,Yeah. Sorry.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:44.62,0:19:47.41,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm genetically inferior on every level!\NWhy should I bother existing?!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:47.41,0:19:50.12,Default,,0,0,0,,Hell, if he asked me out, I'd say yes!\NWhat are you, blind, Yoshikawa?!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:50.12,0:19:51.66,Default,,0,0,0,,I guess that's that, then.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:51.66,0:19:55.33,Default,,0,0,0,,I mean, Ishikawa-{\i1}kun is{\i0}\Na lot more attractive than me.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:55.33,0:19:56.91,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}Stop, I'm already dead{\i0}!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:56.91,0:19:58.87,Default,,0,0,0,,I'd better get going.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:58.87,0:20:02.04,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh, okay.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:02.04,0:20:03.66,Default,,0,0,0,,Yuki!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:03.66,0:20:05.62,Default,,0,0,0,,Why'd you turn him down?! He's a total hottie!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:05.62,0:20:08.83,Default,,0,0,0,,Huh?! Oh... he's kind of {\i1}too {\i0}hot, you know?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:08.83,0:20:11.91,Default,,0,0,0,,And I'm not into like, fancy,\Nexpensive food and stuff.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:11.91,0:20:13.54,Default,,0,0,0,,She's a total pleb.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:13.54,0:20:16.04,Default,,0,0,0,,God, for a second there,\NI thought I'd just died on the spot.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:16.04,0:20:18.20,Default,,0,0,0,,That really scared me. He was {\i1}way {\i0}too hot.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:18.20,0:20:22.04,Default,,0,0,0,,I had no idea we had\Nsomeone like that in our grade.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:23.16,0:20:24.75,Default,,0,0,0,,Yanagi-kun?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:24.75,0:20:28.37,Default,,0,0,0,,Yeah, I know him.\NHe's super hot and totally hilarious.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:28.37,0:20:29.87,Default,,0,0,0,,Hilarious?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:29.87,0:20:30.62,Default,,0,0,0,,{\an8}"WHACK"
Dialogue: 0,0:20:29.87,0:20:30.62,Default,,0,0,0,,Hilarious?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:30.62,0:20:32.12,Default,,0,0,0,,Ouch!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:32.12,0:20:34.20,Default,,0,0,0,,Yanagi, where're your glasses?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:34.20,0:20:36.87,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh, I haven't bought a new pair yet...
Dialogue: 0,0:20:36.87,0:20:38.58,Default,,0,0,0,,But I'm okay, I don't need them that--
Dialogue: 0,0:20:38.58,0:20:39.79,Default,,0,0,0,,Yanagi!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:39.79,0:20:41.58,Default,,0,0,0,,That happens {\i1}all {\i0}the time.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:41.58,0:20:43.12,Default,,0,0,0,,All the time?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:43.12,0:20:46.25,Default,,0,0,0,,His eyesight's really bad.\NHe's practically blind.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:46.25,0:20:48.33,Default,,0,0,0,,He is, huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:55.29,0:20:57.04,Default,,0,0,0,,H-Hey!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:57.04,0:20:58.29,Default,,0,0,0,,Yes?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:58.29,0:21:01.04,Default,,0,0,0,,I think you might've had the wrong girl.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:03.29,0:21:06.91,Default,,0,0,0,,S-So there's this friend of mine, Kyoko Hori.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:06.91,0:21:10.66,Default,,0,0,0,,She's way taller than me,\Nand way prettier than me, too.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:10.66,0:21:13.08,Default,,0,0,0,,A-Are you sure you didn't mean to ask {\i1}her {\i0}out?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:13.08,0:21:15.79,Default,,0,0,0,,Huh? Wait, why are you asking?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:15.79,0:21:22.04,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh, I'm guessing you heard\Nhow bad my eyes are, huh...
Dialogue: 0,0:21:22.04,0:21:23.45,Default,,0,0,0,,I didn't have the wrong person.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:23.45,0:21:24.45,Default,,0,0,0,,Huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:24.45,0:21:26.29,Default,,0,0,0,,I've liked you for quite a while.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:26.29,0:21:28.33,Default,,0,0,0,,So I know what you look like,
Dialogue: 0,0:21:28.33,0:21:30.87,Default,,0,0,0,,but I don't know who this\NHori-san girl is you're talking about.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:30.87,0:21:33.83,Default,,0,0,0,,O-Oh. Okay.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:33.83,0:21:35.20,Default,,0,0,0,,Yuki!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:35.20,0:21:36.04,Default,,0,0,0,,Hori!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:36.04,0:21:38.12,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh, sorry! Didn't mean to interrupt.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:38.12,0:21:39.87,Default,,0,0,0,,Hey, it's Yanagi-kun.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:39.87,0:21:43.41,Default,,0,0,0,,Hori-san? We were just talking about you.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:43.41,0:21:46.25,Default,,0,0,0,,Yoshikawa-san said she had\Nan attractive female friend...
Dialogue: 0,0:21:46.25,0:21:48.37,Default,,0,0,0,,Hello. I'm Miyamura.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:48.37,0:21:50.41,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh, I'm sorry!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:50.41,0:21:52.04,Default,,0,0,0,,Ishikawa-kun, you're here, too!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:52.04,0:21:52.95,Default,,0,0,0,,Nope, I'm Hori.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:52.95,0:21:54.62,Default,,0,0,0,,Sorry! Then who might you be?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:54.62,0:21:57.16,Default,,0,0,0,,Ishikawa. We literally met yesterday.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:57.16,0:22:00.50,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm so sorry, uh... Miyamura-kun!
Dialogue: 0,0:22:00.50,0:22:02.54,Default,,0,0,0,,He kinda needs glasses.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:02.54,0:22:04.04,Default,,0,0,0,,Only kinda?
Dialogue: 0,0:22:04.04,0:22:07.83,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh, right! I just happened to\Nrun into Yoshikawa-san here!
Dialogue: 0,0:22:07.83,0:22:10.91,Default,,0,0,0,,I wasn't trying anything funny, I... huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:22:10.91,0:22:13.83,Default,,0,0,0,,Hori-san, where's Ishikawa-kun?
Dialogue: 0,0:22:13.83,0:22:15.20,Default,,0,0,0,,Over here.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:15.20,0:22:16.70,Default,,0,0,0,,This is hilarious.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:16.70,0:22:17.62,Default,,0,0,0,,--Oh, there you are! I'm so sorry!
Dialogue: 0,0:22:17.62,0:22:19.41,Default,,0,0,0,,--Look, it's fine, Yanagi-kun.\N--Oh, there you are! I'm so sorry!
Dialogue: 0,0:22:19.41,0:22:21.16,Default,,0,0,0,,--Look, it's fine, Yanagi-kun.\N--I swear, nothing funny\Nwas happening here, really!
Dialogue: 0,0:22:21.16,0:22:21.37,Default,,0,0,0,,--Calm down, man!\N--I swear, nothing funny\Nwas happening here, really!
Dialogue: 0,0:22:21.37,0:22:22.58,Default,,0,0,0,,--Calm down, man!
Dialogue: 0,0:23:48.58,0:23:51.91,Default,,0,0,0,,{\an8}"Next Time: It's Hard, but Not Impossible"
